        92.92399597167969,
        629.2916259765625
      ],
      "text": "based on an evaluation of all evidence and judgements made for individual sub-PICOs 2.1, 2.2 and 2.3 and deliberation by the panel. The panel was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.10699462890625,
        77.81756591796875,
        221.2705078125,
        629.2916259765625
      ],
      "text": "Amongst the newly recommended regimens, using BLMZ is suggested over using BLLfxCZ, and BLLfxCZ is suggested over BDLLfxZ. This ranking is  •\t BLLfxCZ, compared to BDLLfxZ was deemed to have a similar but slightly preferable balance of health effects, given the overall desirable effects",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.35899353027344,
        98.45855712890625,
        117.17599487304688,
        629.2916259765625
      ],
      "text": "Following this, the panel was asked to deliberate about the ranking of the three regimens considering their prior judgements and all available",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        143.86300659179688,
        108.62396240234375,
        155.6800079345703,
        629.2916259765625
      ],
      "text": "•\t BLMZ appeared preferable in terms of the balance of health effects, with moderate desirable effects and trivial to no undesirable effects,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        91.10699462890625,
        126.81254577636719,
        102.92399597167969,
        629.2916259765625
      ],
      "text": "first asked to make judgements for each decision criterion about a comparative ranking the regimens (see the ‘Review’ section above).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        245.122802734375,
        161.91024780273438,
        256.9397888183594,
        629.2916259765625
      ],
      "text": "•\t The much greater cost of BDLLfxZ was judged to have likely to have negative effects on equity, acceptability, and feasibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        166.69760131835938,
        184.6971435546875,
        178.5146026611328,
        629.2916259765625
      ],
      "text": "•\t It also has the lowest cost and pill burden and appeared either preferable or equivalent for all other decision criteria",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
